## Fix R2RML generation when ontology URIs contain spaces

Context: R2RML Turtle serialization failed (502) when the domain or ontology
name contained spaces. Changing ontology.base_uri alone did not rewrite stale
class, property, and mapping IRIs, which RDFLib then refused to serialize.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/w3c/r2rml/R2RMLGenerator.py
   Percent-encode illegal IRI characters in base_uri and config-derived URIRefs.
2. src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py
   Sanitize auto-generated and custom base URIs.
3. tests/units/mapping/test_r2rml_generator.py
   Cover spaced base URIs and class URIs.
4. tests/units/domain/test_domain_service.py
   Cover auto and custom base URI sanitization.

Modified files:
- src/back/core/w3c/r2rml/R2RMLGenerator.py
- src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py
